{"metadata": {"team_id": "ucsc", "run_id": "UCSC-SIMRAG-ensemble", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "5-1_7", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "For healthy, low-carb, and high-protein lunch ideas, you have many delicious options!\n\nConsider replacing traditional carbs like white rice and bread with nutrient-dense vegetables. For instance, **cauliflower rice** is an excellent substitute for white rice and can be used in dishes like Cauliflower Fried Rice, or with cheesy chicken, Santa Fe chicken, or Mexican chicken bowls. **Zucchini noodles** can replace pasta in dishes like Zucchini Pad Thai or Lemon Chicken Spaghetti Squash. **Spaghetti squash bolognese** is another great low-carb pasta alternative.\n\n**Lettuce wraps** are a popular choice, easily made with turkey, chicken, or Asian-inspired fillings. You can also create **low-carb bento boxes** featuring eggs, grilled chicken, steak, salmon, or tuna mini-burgers. Chicken, tuna, or seafood salads are also excellent choices, or try **Tamagoyaki**, a Japanese omelet with vegetables and high-quality protein.\n\nFor substantial protein, include lean meats like **grilled chicken, steak, salmon, or tuna**. Chickpeas are also a great source of fiber and protein for low-carb meal prep bowls. You can also make **protein-packed salads** with various low-carb vegetables and add low-fat cheese or cottage cheese. Other ideas include **low-carb meatloaf with cauliflower mash**, **salmon-stuffed avocados**, or **spicy lettuce-wrap tacos**.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0011-92-17473:6": 4.816294030159479, "clueweb22-en0043-00-14527:5": 4.213051245122091, "clueweb22-en0003-79-04263:2": 4.0679792931826135, "clueweb22-en0018-67-19152:5": 3.8529410290332486, "clueweb22-en0041-16-04851:7": 3.599671863350231, "clueweb22-en0019-24-11771:6": 3.5300135109113278, "clueweb22-en0004-23-12560:8": 3.4033129342523964, "clueweb22-en0019-24-11771:5": 3.396337710066348, "clueweb22-en0003-79-04263:1": 3.3435720619358995}, "ptkb_provenance": []